presented with a keyboard shortcut.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A scene’s keyboard shortcut is bound to the command it adds for creating"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"new windows (in the case of "},{"code":"WindowGroup","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"DocumentGroup","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bringing a singleton window forward (in the case of "},{"code":"Window","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and, on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"macOS, "},{"code":"Settings","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"). Pressing the keyboard shortcut is equivalent to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"selecting the menu command."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In cases where a command already has a keyboard shortcut, the scene’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keyboard shortcut is used instead. For example, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WindowGroup"},{"type":"text","text":" normally"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"creates a File > New Window menu command whose keyboard shortcut is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"⌘N"},{"type":"text","text":". The following code changes it to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"⌥⌘N"},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing","code":["WindowGroup {","    ContentView()","}",".keyboardShortcut(\"n\", modifiers: [.option, .command])"]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Localization","anchor":"Localization"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Provide a ","type":"text"},{"code":"localization","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" value to specify how this shortcut","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"should be localized.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Given that "},{"code":"key","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is always defined in relation to the US-English"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keyboard layout, it might be hard to reach on different international"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"layouts. For example the shortcut "},{"code":"⌘[","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" works well for the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"US layout but is hard to reach for German users, where"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"[","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is available by pressing "},{"code":"⌥5","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", making users type "},{"code":"⌥⌘5","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The automatic keyboard shortcut remapping re-assigns the shortcut to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"an appropriate replacement, "},{"code":"⌘Ö","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" in this case."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Providing the option"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/KeyboardShortcut\/Localization-swift.struct\/custom","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"disables the automatic localization for this shortcut to tell the system"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that internationalization is taken care of in a different way."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/scene\/keyboardshortcut(_:modifiers:localization:)"]}],"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/do